# Large reference PDFs.
#
# ref9_ppac_rr_2025_26.pdf is 32 MB. Git stores binaries forever, so once
# pushed it can only be removed by rewriting history - and Render re-clones
# this repository on every deploy. It is a public PPAC document, so a link in
# the deck serves the same purpose at no cost.
#
# To include it anyway:  git add -f ref9_ppac_rr_2025_26.pdf
ref9_ppac_rr_2025_26.pdf
